<title>MEXICO: GFInteracciones 9-month net profit rises.</title>
<headline>GFInteracciones 9-month net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	Oper loss	  15.17 million     loss   5.36 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 257,000		  64,000</p>
<p>	Net		  37.50 million		20.52 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Financiero Interacciones SA</p>
<p>de CV.</p>
<p>	  Net income figure includes profits from financial</p>
<p>group subsidiaries, but revenue figure includes only revenues from the holding company.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, (525) 728-9507</p>
